WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.200
An organ is several tissues working together.

2
00:00:03.977 --> 00:00:07.577
A leaf is an organ: several tissues working together.

3
00:00:10.602 --> 00:00:14.277
Palisade mesophyll does most of the photosynthesis.

4
00:00:17.275 --> 00:00:20.900
Xylem brings water in; phloem carries sugar away.

5
00:00:21.576 --> 00:00:25.926
Cells make tissues; tissues make organs; organs make systems.
